quote:
A limited liability company shall have an auditor to be appointed by the shareholders’ meeting
for one financial year in any of the following circumstances:

1. the number of the company’s shareholders exceeds seven (7) persons;

2. the company’s share capital exceeds fifty thousand (50,000)Omani Rials;

3. the Constitutive Documents provide for the appointment of an auditor; and

4. one or more shareholders representing at least one fifth of the company’s share capital
   request appointment of an auditor.

